2. Enable the bundle. The supported path is the DSH plugin manager
   (Settings → Plugins: enable `@local/dsh-mcp-status`); it edits the profile
   manifest for you. By hand it is the same bundle list:

```json
   "dsh": {
     "profile": {
       "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "@local/dsh-mcp-status"]
     }

3. Restart DSH. The host half activates with the profile; the client half
   appears on the next page load.
